{"stem_en": "A matrix is called non-singular if its determinant is:", "stem_bn": "একটি ম্যাট্রিক্সকে অব্যতিক্রমী বলা হয় যদি এর নির্ণায়ক:", "option_a_en": "equal to zero", "option_a_bn": "শূন্যের সমান", "option_b_en": "not equal to zero", "option_b_bn": "শূন্য নয়", "option_c_en": "equal to one only", "option_c_bn": "কেবল একের সমান", "option_d_en": "negative", "option_d_bn": "ঋণাত্মক", "correct": "B", "difficulty": "easy", "type": "factual", "explanation_en": "Non-singular ⇔ det ≠ 0 (invertible).", "explanation_bn": "অব্যতিক্রমী ⇔ নির্ণায়ক ≠ 0 (বিপরীতযোগ্য)।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p1 ch01; curated bilingual"}
{"stem_en": "If A = [[x+4, 4], [-4, x-4]] is non-singular, then:", "stem_bn": "A = [[x+4, 4], [-4, x-4]] অব্যতিক্রমী হলে:", "option_a_en": "x = 0", "option_a_bn": "x = 0", "option_b_en": "x ≠ 0", "option_b_bn": "x ≠ 0", "option_c_en": "x = 4", "option_c_bn": "x = 4", "option_d_en": "x = -4", "option_d_bn": "x = -4", "correct": "B", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numerical", "explanation_en": "|A| = (x+4)(x-4) + 16 = x^2 ≠ 0 ⇒ x ≠ 0.", "explanation_bn": "ব্যাখ্যা: |A| = x^2 ≠ 0 ⇒ x ≠ 0।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p1 ch01; curated bilingual"}
{"stem_en": "If A = [[7, 6], [8, 7]], then A^{-1} equals:", "stem_bn": "A = [[7, 6], [8, 7]] হলে A^{-1} = ?", "option_a_en": "matrix [[7, 6], [8, 7]]", "option_a_bn": "ম্যাট্রিক্স [[7, 6], [8, 7]]", "option_b_en": "matrix [[7, -6], [-8, 7]]", "option_b_bn": "ম্যাট্রিক্স [[7, -6], [-8, 7]]", "option_c_en": "matrix [[-7, 6], [8, -7]]", "option_c_bn": "ম্যাট্রিক্স [[-7, 6], [8, -7]]", "option_d_en": "matrix [[6, -7], [-8, 7]]", "option_d_bn": "ম্যাট্রিক্স [[6, -7], [-8, 7]]", "correct": "B", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numerical", "explanation_en": "det = 49 − 48 = 1; A^{-1} = [[7, -6], [-8, 7]].", "explanation_bn": "ব্যাখ্যা: det = 1; A^{-1} = [[7, -6], [-8, 7]]।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p1 ch01; curated bilingual"}
{"stem_en": "If A = [[x+4, 8], [2, x-2]] is singular, then x equals:", "stem_bn": "A = [[x+4, 8], [2, x-2]] ব্যতিক্রমী হলে x = ?", "option_a_en": "2 and 4", "option_a_bn": "2 ও 4", "option_b_en": "4 and 6", "option_b_bn": "4 ও 6", "option_c_en": "-4 and 6", "option_c_bn": "-4 ও 6", "option_d_en": "4 and -6", "option_d_bn": "4 ও -6", "correct": "D", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numerical", "explanation_en": "(x+4)(x-2) − 16 = 0 ⇒ x^2 + 2x − 8 − 16 = 0 ⇒ x^2 + 2x − 24 = 0 ⇒ x = 4, −6.", "explanation_bn": "ব্যাখ্যা: (x+4)(x-2) − 16 = 0 ⇒ x^2 + 2x − 24 = 0 ⇒ x = 4, −6।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p1 ch01; curated bilingual"}
